                (maynardS2CoordinateFiberCoefficient H (primorial D) m r) t -
              maynardS2CoordinateFiberSingularSeries D m r * Real.log t| ≤
            11 * maynardS2CoordinateFiberSingularSeries D m r *
              (K + Real.log D +
