edge is the negative of the left-to-right integral. Both vanish at infinity. -/
theorem exists_tendsto_goldfeldContourIntegrand_horizontal_integrals_zero :
    ∃ A : ℕ, 57 ≤ A ∧ ∃ C : ℝ, 0 < C ∧
