        Real.log (BoundedGaps.Maynard.engelsmaMaynardRadius alpha n)) ^ 2 *
      BoundedGaps.Maynard.reciprocalTotientTupleWeight largePowerTuple u
  rw [reciprocalTotientTupleWeight_eq_one_div_product]
